# ==============================================================================
# COMMIT MESSAGE TEMPLATE — ImageContext-Generator
# ==============================================================================
# Aktifkan: git config commit.template .gitmessage
# Format:   <type>(<scope>): <deskripsi>
# Contoh:  feat(release): auto versioning + changelog via git-cliff
# ==============================================================================
# <type>(<scope>): <deskripsi singkat, imperatif, lowercase>
#
# <body opsional — jelaskan WHY, bukan WHAT. Baris maksimal 72 karakter.>
#
# <footer opsional — BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Refs: #123, dll.>
#
# ==============================================================================
# TYPE:
#   feat     : fitur baru (minor bump)
#   fix      : perbaikan bug (patch bump)
#   docs     : dokumentasi saja
#   refactor : refactor tanpa perubahan perilaku
#   perf     : perbaikan performa
#   test     : tambah/ubah test
#   chore    : maintenance, dependency, build tooling
#   ci       : perubahan CI/CD workflow
#   build    : perubahan build system
#
# SCOPE: modul/fitur terdampak (reference, vision, cli, engine, release, dll.)
# ==============================================================================
